{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack contains different skins and sounds for already existing weapons and blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: These are NOT new blocks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply Pack: Frontline allows you to change essential blocks into weapons and motors inspired by technology from the 20th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following will have brand new looks and sounds unlocked:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Smart Cannon and Tiny Cannon:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the two Cannon skins into guns inspired by the M1919 used in World War 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minigun:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the Minigun into a Vickers-inspired model from 1912.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raw Engine:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the Raw Engine into a bulky Straight-Six Diesel Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BullDawg Engine:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the Bulldawg Engine into a small 1 Cylinder Engine, ideal for motorbikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dragon Engine:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the Dragon Engine into a larger version of the Bulldawg - Two Cylinder based on the British Royal Enfield engine.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729370?t=1749547063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729370?t=1749547063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729370/6d6d8c007cdf05037f9a6a419adb8d28b3685514/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749547063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729370/6d6d8c007cdf05037f9a6a419adb8d28b3685514/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749547063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"de